    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC CDS-II Recruitment 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-11T10:12:38+05:30\"\u003eJune 11, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:12 am\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/whats-new\"\u003eUnion Public Service Commission UPSC\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released \u003cstrong\u003ea notification\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for the Recruitment of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExamination of Combined Defence Service CDS-II 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eUPSC application form\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;has started on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"410\"\u003e20 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates can apply until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"458\"\u003e11 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. candidates must be born not earlier than 01 July 2003 and not later than 01 July 2008. Candidates must check the complete details for \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS-II Recruitment 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Provided below.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e(Advt. No. 11/2026-CDS-II)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC CDS-II Online Form 2026 – Last Date Today\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Combined Defence Services CDS II Examination 2026 : Short Details \u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsc-cds-2-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e20 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e11 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e11 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date\u003cstrong\u003e : 13 September 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eBefore Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeneral / OBC \u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 200/-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSC / ST\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e/ All Female :\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 0/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Combined Defence Services CDS II Notification 2026 : Age Limit As On UPSC Rules.\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ecandidates born not earlier than \u003cstrong\u003e01 July 2003 and not later than 01 July 2008\u003c/strong\u003e are eligible.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAge Relaxation Extra as per \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Examination 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e451 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eUPSC Combined Defence Services CDS II Recruitment 2026 :\u0026nbsp;Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"125\"\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIndian Military Academy IMA\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e100\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"125\"\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAir Force Academy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"120\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e32\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIndian Naval Academy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e26\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOfficers Training Academy OTA\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e293\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; UPSC CDS II Recruitment 2026 : \u003c/span\u003eEligibility Criteria\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor IMA \u0026amp; OTA\u003c/strong\u003e: Must have a \u003cstrong\u003eBachelor’s degree in any stream\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor Naval Academy\u003c/strong\u003e: Must have a \u003cstrong\u003eBachelor’s degree in Engineering\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor Air Force\u003c/strong\u003e: Must have a \u003cstrong\u003eBachelor’s degree in any stream\u003c/strong\u003e, but should have studied \u003cstrong\u003ePhysics and Math in 10+2\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor more details read the official notification before applying.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Fill UPSC CDS II Online Form 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInterested candidates who wish to apply for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eUPSC\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003epost can submit their application online before\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e11 June 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUse the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAlternatively, visit the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website of UPSC\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eto complete the application process online.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMake sure to complete the application before the deadline\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003ca style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upsc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e11 June 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eNote – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eOfficial Notification\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे । (\u003cstrong\u003eLast Date, Age Limit, \u0026amp; Education Qualification\u003c/strong\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;UPSC CDS II Recruitment 2026 : \u003c/span\u003eMode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"wp-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWritten Test\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSB Interview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/spa