ent 2026\u003c/strong\u003e Start?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e The online application for this recruitment has started on \u003cstrong\u003e20 May\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the last date for online application for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS II\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Online Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The last date for online application Form is \u003cstrong\u003e11 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pt-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e What is the age limit for \u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS II\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bharti 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The age limit for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS II\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bharti 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e is as follows on official notification.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the eligibility for \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS II\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eVacancy 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer: \u003c/strong\u003eThe eligibility criteria for the \u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUPSC CDS II\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Vacancy 2026\u003c/strong\u003e are as follows\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;read the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial notification\u003c/strong\u003e carefully before applying.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c